\">\n      It has great performance with excellent stability\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>05/24/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3080-O10G-GAMING Media review Award of Best of IT Award 2020\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.plugmedia.hk/itaward/public/2020/asus_rog_3080.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1272/202002241500381010968.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"HKEPC Editor's Choice 2020\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      HKEPC\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>HKEPC Editor's Choice 2020</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      powerful cooling ability, stable over-clocking performance and product quality\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>10/05/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3080-O10G-GAMING Media review Award of HKEPC Editor's Choice 2020\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hkepc.com/19819/RTX_3080_%E5%8D%A1%E7%9A%87%E7%99%BB%E5%A0%B4__ASUS_ROG_STRIX_RTX_3080_GAMING_OC?fbclid=IwAR2AxaeP3EpITOaWEECnPDk2a7dXbl4E2fqX_s_anjRQh0ZqJOHwDtiQgX0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1354/202009261429256300790.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gadget Voize Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      gadgetvoize.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gadget Voize Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      It offers brilliant build quality and top-end components, revamped and better cooling system, overclocking capabilities, and blockbuster performance, all the while keeping itself cool under all circumstances. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>UNITED ARAB EMIRATES</span> <span>09/24/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3080-O10G-GAMING Media review Award of Gadget Voize Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.gadgetvoize.com/2020/09/24/exclusive-review-asus-strix-rtx-3080-10gb-oc-edition/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1332/202104081131011690546.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editor's Choice 2021\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      HardwareZone.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editor's Choice 2021</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS card ultimately came ahead because of its strong performance in areas that really matter, such as cooling.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SINGAPORE</span> <span>04/12/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3080-O10G-GAMING Media review Award of Editor's Choice 2021\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwarezone.com.sg/feature-best-gaming-gear-headphones-mouse-gpu-cpu-graphics-card-game-console-tech-awards-2021-editors-choice/best-graphics-card-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202104191540377710185.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Red Dot Product Design 2021\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Red Dot\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Red Dot Product Design 2021</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n       The winner of the Red Dot Award: Product Design 2021\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>04/12/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3080-O10G-GAMING Media review Award of Red Dot Product Design 2021\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.red-dot.org/search/product-design?tx_solr%5Bfilter%5D%5B0%5D=result_type%3Aonline_exhibition&amp;tx_solr%5Bfilter%5D%5B1%5D=online_exhibition_type%3AProduct+Design&amp;cHash=e15387a33b21920932e36933b3aaea1d&amp;q=ASUS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1225/202010221354474860923.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"100/100\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      TweakTown\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>100/100</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      If you can find one, and actually buy it -- the ASUS ROG Strix GeForce RTX 3080 OC Edition is the best RTX 3080 yet. It also runs chilly, and doesn't need any manual OC for maximum performance. \n\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>AUSTRALIA</span> <span>10/05/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3080-O10G-GAMING Media review Award of 100/100\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.tweaktown.com/reviews/9614/asus-rog-strix-geforce-rtx-3080-oc-edition/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1302/202109231538594540667.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"9.2 / 10 \" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      the axo\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>9.2 / 10 </p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The Asus TUF Gaming RTX 3080 OC is a great alternative to the Nvidia’s Founder Edition card. Its stock performance is already better than the Nvidia Founder’s Edition, and while the OC FPS isn’t really noticeable, it’s nice to have the option to Overclock.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>MALAYSIA</span> <span>06/28/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RTX3080-O10G-GAMING Media review Award of 9.2 / 10 \" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://theaxo.com/2021/asus-tuf-gaming-rtx-3080-oc-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-h